{"overview":"Dr. Bill Cortner and his fiancée, Jan Compton, are driving to his lab when they get into a horrible car accident. Compton is decapitated. But Cortner is not fazed by this seemingly insurmountable hurdle. His expertise is in transplants, and he is excited to perform the first head transplant. Keeping Compton's head alive in his lab, Cortner plans the groundbreaking yet unorthodox surgery. First, however, he needs a body.","tagline":"Alive... without a body... fed by an unspeakable horror from hell!","cast":[{"n":"Jason Evers","c":"Dr. Bill Cortner  (as Herb Evers)","p":"/jbm0AiJvYowMoaDOEZQCcAoiEOx.jpg","q":"Q514461"},{"n":"Virginia Leith","c":"Jan Compton","p":"/cMZ7Cqx6wohiKd2cR0VjwXLQIeZ.jpg","q":"Q11835811"},{"n":"Leslie Daniels","c":"Kurt","p":"/4uWNXxq3846bUtneOcDA08N6qKD.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Adele Lamont","c":"Doris Powell","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Bonnie Sharie","c":"Blonde Stripper","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Doris Brent","c":"Nurse","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Paula Morris","c":"Brunet Stripper","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Marilyn Hanold","c":"Peggy Howard","p":"/afXJVfSIlqTzV5fsFuMt8do54PA.jpg","q":"Q6763541"},{"n":"Bruce Brighton","c":"Dr. Cortner","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Arny Freeman","c":"Photographer","p":"/rTiBXkTyGjxrrc0hXMd9FFdxTTJ.jpg","q":"Q4795444"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Brain_That_Wouldn%27t_Die","qid":"Q129074","rel":{"CA":{"d":"1962-02-25","c":"18A"},"DE":{"d":"1962-02-25","c":"16"},"GB":{"d":"2010-08-15","c":"PG"},"US":{"d":"1962-08-10","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/ooH1YPYzWtFk9q2zrtTnoryXYwC.jpg","/rlGq9CU2O5ii0nxWJUi6fMVZlhQ.jpg","/wlGr85Ul2XREL9F4bFdBVcoZjmJ.jpg","/9TLRPrl3ErfmnGSPiR1nVywFB7D.jpg","/gU3aMYa0rgZWjQ9pMbAVMlug81J.jpg","/oQMfNNcV4aEQMzXUsrqKYzvkE3G.jpg","/buQebas99PZxvZH8WOPZZgXKpQP.jpg","/llA08bIpWp3yTVRyoauJuVTI3Zg.jpg"]}